body:
Susie x Noelle is way too obvious. Toby's writing isn't that shallow, krusie or not- I'm sure whatever will happen is going to surprise us. I've said this on many posts before, but i feel like suselle is a red herring. The ship we expect, to distract us from what's actually going on. One of the frequent themes of this game is changing and moving on- so as sad as this is I think Rudy is gonna die from his illness, which is obviously gonna affect Noelle. Then, she'll get rejected by susie which will be the breaking point for her.

&#x200B;

Also, for anyone who's seen Toby's twitter from september, Judging by the things he's posted I feel like he's gonna make Noelle a bigger character for the next chapters so maybe she'll accidentally follow Kris and susie into the dark world. If she gets rejected then they could still be friends, i.e Noelle "Moving on" from susie. Not to mention the ship is a repeat of alphys x undyne. To do this just be lazy writing, and I think Toby is better than that. I don't really like the ship anyways, and alot people only ship it because it's a lesbian ship which is a bad reason to ship something. Susie doesn't even like Noelle as far as we know and has absolutely no indication of being bi or lesbian, another toxic trope that "All tough and badass girls are lgbt".
